Real Optimism is: 
Being aware of problems but recognizing solutions; 
Knowing about difficulties but believing they can be overcome; 
Seeing the negatives, but accentuating the positives; 
Being exposed to the worst but expecting the best; 
Having reason to complain, but choosing to smile.

Let us enter 2021 with real optimism. 
Wish you all an Abundant and Prosperous 2021 blessed with Wealth, Wisdom and Wellness.

